-- title:
--   A maximal ideal containing p lies over p
-- statement:
--   Let $\eta\in\mathbb C$, $p$ a prime, and $\mathfrak m$ a maximal ideal of $\mathbb Z[\eta]$ with $p\in\mathfrak m$. Then
--   $$
--   \mathfrak m\cap\mathbb Z=(p).
--   $$
--
--   So $\mathfrak m$ lies over the rational prime $p$.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/lean/OAI/LinearAlgebra/CirculantHadamard/CyclotomicLocalBase.lean#L166-L181

